  description: '2 monsters with different Levels

    If a monster is Special Summoned
    face-up to a zone this card points to while you control this monster (except
    during the Damage Step): You can declare a Level from 1 to 8; that monster becomes
    that Level until the end of the turn. You can target 2 monsters with the same
    Level (1 from each field); destroy them. You can only use each effect of "Puzzlomino,
    the Drop-n-Deleter" once per turn.'
